@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title Hình 6.12 — Sequence Diagram: Xuất PDF phiếu lương
actor "Employee" as E
participant "UI /payslips" as UI
participant "API Route" as API
participant "PayslipService" as SVC
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

E -> UI : Vào /payslips\n→ Chọn kỳ lương
UI -> DB : SELECT payslip\nWHERE employeeId, month, year
DB --> UI : Payslip + Payroll data
UI --> E : Hiển thị chi tiết phiếu lương
UI -> DB : UPDATE Payslip\nSET isViewed=true
E -> UI : Nhấn "Tải PDF"
UI -> API : GET /api/export/\npayslip-pdf?id=xxx
API -> SVC : generatePDF(payslipId)
SVC -> DB : SELECT payroll\n+ employee data
DB --> SVC : Full data
SVC -> SVC : Tạo PDF với jsPDF\n(header, bảng lương, chữ ký)
SVC --> API : PDF Buffer
API --> UI : Response\n(blob, application/pdf)
UI --> E : Browser tải file PDF
@enduml
